From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 8 May 2026 13:52:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4929/5749] fix(web): actually ignore .wrangler/ as
 web/AGENTS.md claims

Code-quality review flagged that web/AGENTS.md ANTI-PATTERNS section
asserts `.wrangler/` is gitignored, but the rule was missing from
web/.gitignore. Adding the rule alongside the other Cloudflare/Next
build-output rules so the doc and the file agree.
---
 web/.gitignore | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/web/.gitignore b/web/.gitignore
index 1ee9c8e2..769e3b67 100644
--- a/web/.gitignore
+++ b/web/.gitignore
@@ -21,6 +21,9 @@
 /out/
 /.open-next/
 
+# cloudflare / wrangler
+/.wrangler/
+
 # production
 /build
 
